<infoparam name="UML Note" value="The Obstacle Avoidance System goes into the state of  &apos;Detecting Obstacles&apos;.

(This system consists of simple sensors to detect obstacles).

If no obstacle detected then it would go into loop.
If obstacle detected then the &apos;Autopilot&apos; receives signal &apos;ObstacleDetected&apos; and it maneuvers.

Camera Driver receives signal &apos;obstacleAvoided&apos;  and continues to take picture
" />
